utton></li><li value=\"42\">Report to the Skentz post quartermaster <span class=\"muted\">at 572, 649</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"572|649|Report to the Skentz post quartermaster\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"43\">Report to the Skentz post quartermaster <span class=\"muted\">at 572, 648</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"572|648|Report to the Skentz post quartermaster\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"44\">Report to the Skentz post quartermaster <span class=\"muted\">at 572, 648</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"572|648|Report to the Skentz post quartermaster\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"45\">Report to the Skentz post quartermaster <span class=\"muted\">at 572, 649</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"572|649|Report to the Skentz post quartermaster\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"46\">Report to the Skentz post quartermaster <span class=\"muted\">at 572, 648</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"572|648|Report to the Skentz post quartermaster\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>1,280</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>40,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>1</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-talk\"><h2>What Sergeant Bennet Vale says</h2><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Fred Skentz:</b> Black wax. Raiders don&#39;t seal anything. They can&#39;t be bothered.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Fred Skentz:</b> The stamp on this chit and on the tokens is a Thak paymaster&#39;s mark. I&#39;ve had their coin across my counter. It&#39;s heavy and badly struck, and nobody out here mints it but the Thak.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Fred Skentz:</b> So the outriders ride on Thak pay. I&#39;ll keep these. Go and tell the Bloomguard quartermaster at the post by my gate before somebody offers to buy the news off you.</p></div><div class=\"q-conv\"><p class=\"q-you\"><b>You:</b> Fred Skentz says the outriders are on Thak pay. Talin&#39;s chit carries a Thak paymaster&#39;s stamp.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Bloomguard Quartermaster:</b> Then Sergeant Vale was right, and I owe him a drink.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Bloomguard Quartermaster:</b> If the Thak are paying raiders this far west, they want the road watched before their scouts come down it. Agauton needs to hear that. I&#39;ll send a rider east tonight.</p><p class=\"q-npc\"><b>Bloomguard Quartermaster:</b> Here&#39;s your pay from the post&#39;s box. Sergeant Vale said you&#39;d earn it.</p></div></section><section id=\"g-end\"><h2>Handing it in</h2><p class=\"q-end\"><i>\"Here&#39;s your pay from the post&#39;s box. Sergeant Vale said you&#39;d earn it.\"</i></p></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>Outriders</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-outriders\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-outriders\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-outriders\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-outriders\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-outriders\" data-g-jump=\"g-talk\">What Sergeant Bennet Vale says</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-wastelands-outriders\" data-g-jump=\"g-end\">Handing it in</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul>